00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:30.180
But she wasn't hurt that bad.

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:32.260
She just had some scuffs and bruises

00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:33.803
and she was all right.

00:02:34.640 --> 00:02:35.760
I felt better about it

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:40.510
but still lo and behold I still got a DUI.

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:41.573
DUI number one.

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:43.710
After DUI number one,

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:45.520
I went to school,

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:47.740
did all the work that I did in the school.

00:02:47.740 --> 00:02:51.000
At the school, continued
to drink of course.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.050
Even going to school, continued to drink.

00:02:54.264 --> 00:02:56.270
I got another DUI, DUI number two.

00:02:56.270 --> 00:03:00.500
This was in Long Beach after my wife,

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:03.697
