to about 15 rehabs by now.

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:11.800
I know AA,

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:13.090
NA, CA.

00:03:13.090 --> 00:03:15.200
I can quote scriptures
from any of those books.

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:16.240
I know the Bible very well.

00:03:16.240 --> 00:03:18.678
My name is the third book in
the Old Testament, Leviticus.

00:03:18.678 --> 00:03:19.511
- [Mark] (laughs) Right.

00:03:19.511 --> 00:03:20.820
- So,

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:23.223
you know, of course I'm
well learned in that area.

00:03:24.380 --> 00:03:27.510
But one day I was
introduced to crack cocaine.

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:28.457
